"3	CHAR	0
	👉 Example: In my spare time, I enjoy simple leisure activities like reading or walking.
	
	quality time /ˈkwɑːləti taɪm/ – khoảng thời gian ý nghĩa
	Example: I try to spend quality time with my family at the weekend.
	
	recreational activities /ˌrekriˈeɪʃənl ækˈtɪvətiz/ – hoạt động giải trí
	Example: Recreational activities such as swimming help me stay energetic.
	
	to kill time /kɪl taɪm/ – giết thời gian
	Example: I usually play mobile games to kill time when I’m waiting for the bus.
	
	to take up a hobby /teɪk ʌp ə ˈhɑːbi/ – bắt đầu một sở thích
	Example: Recently, I’ve taken up a hobby of cooking new dishes.
	
	to wind down /waɪnd daʊn/ – thư giãn, xả stress
	Example: I often listen to music in the evening to wind down after work.
	
	to be pressed for time /prest fɔː taɪm/ – thiếu thời gian
	Example: I don’t usually have much spare time because I’m often pressed for time.
	
	to recharge my batteries /riːˈtʃɑːrdʒ maɪ ˈbætəriz/ – nạp lại năng lượng
	Example: Spending time outdoors helps me recharge my batteries.
